[TD][I]rtp.params[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]/rtp menu[/I][/TD]
[TD]Interactive book (Paper / Folia) or chat-paginated menu[/TD]
[TD][I]rtp.use[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]/rtp info[/I][/TD]
[TD]Operator diagnostics dashboard (queue, latency, leak rate, TPS/MSPT)[/TD]
[TD][I]rtp.info[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]/rtp reload [file][/I][/TD]
