[SPOILER='Configuration files at a glance']
LeafRTP-Pro splits configuration by concern under [I]plugins/RTP/[/I]. Every file is hot-reloadable ([I]/rtp reload <file>[/I]) and editable in-game via [I]/rtp config <file>[/I].
[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]File[/TH]
[TH]Scope[/TH]
[TH]Example keys[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]config.yml[/I][/TD]
[TD]Core / global behavior, database, menu renderer[/TD]
[TD][I]teleportDelay[/I], [I]teleportCooldown[/I], [I]cancelDistance[/I], [I]database.type[/I], [I]menu.renderer[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]regions/<name>.yml[/I][/TD]
[TD]Per-region shape, radius, center, queue, price, gates[/TD]
[TD][I]shape[/I], [I]vert[/I], [I]radius[/I], [I]cacheCap[/I], [I]price[/I], [I]requirePermission[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]worlds/<name>.yml[/I][/TD]
[TD]Per-world region routing and overrides[/TD]
[TD][I]region[/I], [I]override[/I], [I]requirePermission[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]safety.yml[/I][/TD]
[TD]Block / biome safety filter (Pro token grammar)[/TD]
[TD][I]unsafeBlocks[/I], [I]airBlocks[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]economy.yml[/I][/TD]
[TD]Vault pricing (Pro)[/TD]
[TD][I]price[/I], [I]priceOther[/I], [I]biomePrice[/I], [I]balanceFloor[/I], [I]refundOnCancel[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]effects/<name>.yml[/I][/TD]
[TD]Lifecycle effects (particles, sounds, fireworks, potions)[/TD]
[TD]per-phase effect definitions[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]performance.yml[/I][/TD]
[TD]Tick budgets, queue caps, caches[/TD]
[TD][I]maxAttempts[/I], [I]syncAllottedTime[/I], [I]minTPS[/I], [I]loginCacheEnabled[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]network.yml[/I][/TD]
[TD]Proxy / multi-server selector (Pro)[/TD]
[TD][I]enabled[/I], transport settings[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]integrations.yml[/I][/TD]
[TD]Claim-plugin reroll toggles[/TD]
[TD][I]rerollWorldGuard[/I], [I]rerollGriefPrevention[/I], -[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]logging.yml[/I][/TD]
[TD]Log verbosity and channels[/TD]
[TD]logging toggles[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]metrics.yml[/I][/TD]
[TD]Runtime-health metrics[/TD]
[TD]metrics toggles[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]language.yml[/I][/TD]
[TD]Locale selection[/TD]
[TD][I]language[/I][/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]messages.yml[/I][/TD]
[TD]User-facing text (fully localizable, REQ-RTP-F-013)[/TD]
[TD]message templates[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD][I]lang/**[/I][/TD]
[TD]Bundled translations (Pro)[/TD]
[TD]per-locale value files[/TD]
[/TR]
[/TABLE]
[/SPOILER]

